rMsgId = _bmFkMid;\n              _bmSmugglerFigIdx = _bmFkIdx;\n              break;\n            }\n          }\n          if (_bmSmugglerFk) break;\n        }\n        if (!_bmSmugglerFk) continue; // no alive SMUGGLER \u2014 skip\n        // Peek at top CC deck card\n        const _bmDeckKey = pn === 1 ? 'player1CcDeck' : 'player2CcDeck';\n        const _bmDeck = game[_bmDeckKey] || [];\n        if (_bmDeck.length === 0) continue; // empty deck \u2014 skip\n        const _bmTopCard = _bmDeck[0];\n        const _bmCcEff = getCcEffect(_bmTopCard);\n        const _bmCardCost = _bmCcEff?.cost ?? 0;\n        const _bmOwnerId = game[`player${pn}Id`];\n        const _bmRow = new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(\n          new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`bm_draw_${gameId}_${_bmMid}_${pn}`).setLabel(`Draw (spend ${_bmCardCost} VP)`).setStyle(ButtonStyle.Success)\x2C\n          new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`bm_discard_${gameId}_${_bmMid}_${pn}`).setLabel(`Discard (gain ${_bmCardCost} VP)`).setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\x2C\n          new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`bm_return_${gameId}_${_bmMid}_${pn}`).setLabel('Return to top').setStyle(ButtonStyle.Secondary)\x2C\n          new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`bm_skip_${gameId}_${_bmMid}_${pn}`).setLabel('Skip').setStyle(ButtonStyle.Secondary)\x2C\n        );\n        // Store pending state so the handler knows which card/smuggler to apply\n        game.pendingBlackMarket = game.pendingBlackMarket || {};\n        game.pendingBlackMarket[pn] = {\n          topCard: _bmTopCard\x2C\n          cardCost: _bmCardCost\x2C\n          smugglerFk: _bmSmugglerFk\x2C\n          smugglerMsgId: _bmSmugglerMsgId\x2C\n          smugglerFigIdx: _bmSmugglerFigIdx\x2C\n        };\n        const _bmSmugglerName = dcNameFromFigureKey(_bmSmugglerFk);\n        await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `<@${_bmOwnerId}> **[Black Market]** \u2014 Top CC revealed: **${_bmTopCard}** (cost ${_bmCardCost}). A friendly SMUGGLER (**${_bmSmugglerName}**) may suffer 1 Strain. Choose:`\x2C {\n          components: [_bmRow]\x2C\n          allowedMentions: { users: [_bmOwnerId] }\x2C\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // [Doubt] SU: at end of round\x2C choose hostile figure\x2C discard 1 condition or Power Token\n  for (const pn of [1\x2C 2]) {\n    const _dbtDcList = getDcList(game\x2C pn) || [];\n    const _dbtMsgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C pn) || [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < _dbtDcList.length; i++) {\n      const _dbtDc = _dbtDcList[i];\n      if (!_dbtDc || _dbtDc.defeated) continue;\n      if ((_dbtDc.dcName || _dbtDc) !== '[Doubt]') continue;\n      const _dbtMid = _dbtMsgIds[i];\n      if (!_dbtMid) continue;\n      if (isDepletedRemovedFromGame(game\x2C _dbtMid)) continue;\n      // Find hostile figures with conditions or power tokens\n      const oppPn = pn === 1 ? 2 : 1;\n      const oppFigs = game.figurePositions?.[oppPn] || {};\n      const _dbtCandidates = [];\n      for (const [fk\x2C pos] of Object.entries(oppFigs)) {\n        if (!pos) continue;\n        const conds = game.figureConditions?.[fk] || [];\n        const tokens = game.figurePowerTokens?.[fk] || [];\n        if (conds.length === 0 && tokens.length === 0) continue;\n        _dbtCandidates.push({ fk\x2C dcName: dcNameFromFigureKey(fk)\x2C conds\x2C tokens });\n      }\n      if (_dbtCandidates.length === 0) continue;\n      const _dbtOwnerId = game[`player${pn}Id`];\n      const _dbtBtns = _dbtCandidates.slice(0\x2C 24).map(({ fk\x2C dcName: dn\x2C conds\x2C tokens }) => {\n        const info = [...conds\x2C ...tokens.map(t => `${t} Token`)].join('\x2C ');\n        const label = `${dn}: ${info}`;\n        return new ButtonBuilder()\n          .setCustomId(`doubt_fig_${gameId}_${pn}_${fk}`)\n          .setLabel(truncateLabel(label))\n          .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger);\n      });\n      _dbtBtns.push(new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`doubt_fig_${gameId}_${pn}_skip`).setLabel('Skip').setStyle(ButtonStyle.Secondary));\n      const _dbtRows = chunkButtonsToRows(_dbtBtns);\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `<@${_dbtOwnerId}> **[Doubt]** \u2014 Choose a hostile figure to discard 1 condition or Power Token:`\x2C {\n        components: _dbtRows.slice(0\x2C 5)\x2C\n        allowedMentions: { users: [_dbtOwnerId] }\x2C\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  // Mission end-of-round rules (also Step 3 \u2014 grouped with DC ability EoR effects)\n  const variant = game.selectedMission?.variant;\n  const missionRules = getMissionRules?.(mapId\x2C variant) ?? {};\n  const endOfRoundRules = missionRules.endOfRound;\n  if (endOfRoundRules && runEndOfRoundRules) {\n    const ruleCtx = { logGameAction\x2C checkWinConditions\x2C getMapTokensData\x2C getSpaceController\x2C isFigureInDeploymentZone\x2C getFiguresOnOrAdjacentToSpace\x2C client };\n    const { gameEnded } = await runEndOfRoundRules(game\x2C mapId\x2C variant\x2C endOfRoundRules\x2C ruleCtx);\n    if (gameEnded) {\n      if (interaction?.message) await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n      saveGames();\n      return;\n    }\n    // Check for power token overflow from mission rules (fluctuation/crate tokens)\n    if (game.pendingPowerTokenOverflow?.length > 0) {\n      const _ovCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C game.generalId);\n      if (_ovCh) {\n        const _ovEntry = game.pendingPowerTokenOverflow[0];\n        // Determine owning player from figure positions\n        const _ovPn = Object.entries(game.figurePositions || {}).find(([\x2C figs]) => figs?.[_ovEntry.figureKey])?.[0];\n        await sendPowerTokenOverflowUI(game\x2C gameId\x2C _ovCh\x2C _ovPn ? parseInt(_ovPn\x2C 10) : 1\x2C saveGames);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // NPC thug activation (Corellian Underground A)\n  if (runNpcThugActivation && mapId === 'corellian-underground' && variant === 'a') {\n    const { logs: thugLogs\x2C damageEvents } = runNpcThugActivation(game\x2C mapId\x2C { getMapTokensData\x2C getMapData\x2C getMapRegistry\x2C filterMapSpacesByBounds });\n    for (const line of thugLogs) {\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udd2b **Thug:** ${line}`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'attack' });\n    }\n    for (const { figureKey\x2C playerNum\x2C damage } of damageEvents) {\n      await applyNpcDamageToFigure(game\x2C playerNum\x2C figureKey\x2C damage\x2C 'Thug'\x2C logGameAction\x2C client\x2C dcHealthState\x2C dcMessageMeta);\n    }\n    if (damageEvents.length > 0) {\n      await checkWinConditions(game\x2C client);\n      if (game.ended) {\n        if (interaction?.message) await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n        saveGames();\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // NPC Krykna push+damage phase (Chopper Base A): build push queue here; damage runs after all pushes (in modal handler)\n\n  // NOTE: Hardy + Regenerate already processed above (lines 103-154). Duplicate block removed.\n\n  // Fluctuation swap gate (Lothal Wastes B): each player may swap 1 fluctuation in initiative order\n  if (mapId === 'lothal-wastes' && variant === 'b') {\n    const _fInitNum = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n    const _fOtherNum = opponentPlayerNum(_fInitNum);\n    game.pendingFluctuationSwapQueue = [_fInitNum\x2C _fOtherNum];\n    game.fluctuationSwappedThisRound = [];\n    game.pendingFluctuationSwapFirst = null;\n    game._pendingStatusPhaseLog = { p1Terminals\x2C p1HasRHC\x2C p2Terminals\x2C p2HasRHC\x2C p1DrawCount\x2C p2DrawCount\x2C hadCutLines };\n    const _fGenCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C game.generalId);\n    if (postFluctuationSwapButtons) {\n      await postFluctuationSwapButtons(game\x2C _fGenCh\x2C gameId\x2C _fInitNum);\n    }\n    if (interaction?.message) await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  await _runInitiativeSwapAndContinue(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx\x2C\n    { p1Terminals\x2C p1HasRHC\x2C p2Terminals\x2C p2HasRHC\x2C p1DrawCount\x2C p2DrawCount\x2C hadCutLines });\n}\n\n/**\n * Continuation after fluctuation swap (or when no swap needed).\n * Runs initiative swap\x2C status phase log\x2C mission SOR gate\x2C and continues to activation phase.\n */\nasync function _runInitiativeSwapAndContinue(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx\x2C logVars) {\n  const {\n    logGameAction\x2C client\x2C saveGames\x2C\n    getMissionRules\x2C getMapTokensData\x2C runStartOfRoundRules\x2C\n    getInitiativePlayerZoneLabel\x2C\n  } = ctx;\n  const { p1Terminals\x2C p1HasRHC\x2C p2Terminals\x2C p2HasRHC\x2C p1DrawCount\x2C p2DrawCount\x2C hadCutLines } = logVars;\n  const mapId = game.selectedMap?.id;\n  const variant = game.selectedMission?.variant;\n  const missionRules = getMissionRules?.(mapId\x2C variant) ?? {};\n\n  const prevInitiative = game.initiativePlayerId;\n  game.initiativePlayerId = prevInitiative === game.player1Id ? game.player2Id : game.player1Id;\n  game.currentRound = (game.currentRound || 1) + 1;\n  setRoundPhase(game\x2C ROUND_PHASES.START_OF_ROUND);\n  game.startOfRoundWhoseTurn = game.initiativePlayerId;\n  cleanupRoundStart(game);\n\n  // Status Phase summary log (posted before mission SOR may pause for player prompt)\n  const generalChannel = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C game.generalId);\n  const p1DrawDetail = `${p1Terminals} terminal${p1Terminals !== 1 ? 's' : ''}${p1HasRHC ? ' + Rebel High Command' : ''}`;\n  const p2DrawDetail = `${p2Terminals} terminal${p2Terminals !== 1 ? 's' : ''}${p2HasRHC ? ' + Rebel High Command' : ''}`;\n  const drawDesc = hadCutLines\n    ? 'No Command card draw this round (Cut Lines).'\n    : `P1 drew ${p1DrawCount} card${p1DrawCount !== 1 ? 's' : ''} (${p1DrawDetail}). P2 drew ${p2DrawCount} card${p2DrawCount !== 1 ? 's' : ''} (${p2DrawDetail}). \u2713`;\n  const initZone = getInitiativePlayerZoneLabel(game);\n  const initNum = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**Status Phase** \u2014 1. Ready cards \u2713 2. ${drawDesc} 3. End of round effects (scoring) \u2713 4. Initiative passes to ${initZone}P${initNum} <@${game.initiativePlayerId}>. Round **${game.currentRound}**.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n\n  // Mission SOR: if randomRevealAndPlaceStrain\x2C prompt players before auto-reveal\n  if (missionRules?.startOfRound?.randomRevealAndPlaceStrain) {\n    const missionName = game.selectedMission?.name || 'Mission Effect';\n    const row = new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(\n      new ButtonBuilder()\n        .setCustomId(`sor_mission_reveal_${gameId}`)\n        .setLabel('Reveal Mission Tokens')\n        .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n    );\n    await generalChannel.send({\n      content: `\u26a1 **Round ${game.currentRound} \u2014 ${missionName}** \u2014 Each player randomly reveals 1 set-aside mission token. Either player: press to reveal.`\x2C\n      components: [row]\x2C\n    });\n    game.pendingMissionSorReveal = true;\n    if (interaction?.message) {\n      await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    }\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  if (runStartOfRoundRules && missionRules?.startOfRound) {\n    await runStartOfRoundRules(game\x2C mapId\x2C variant\x2C missionRules.startOfRound\x2C { logGameAction\x2C client\x2C getMapTokensData });\n  }\n  await _continueAfterMissionSor(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx);\n}\n\n/**\n * Shared start-of-round continuation helper. Runs every effect that must fire\n * after mission SOR rules are in place:\n *   - CC passive start-of-round redraws (Rebel Graffiti / Sabine)\n *   - DC start-of-round passives (Brush\x2C Force Slow\x2C Excavation\x2C etc.)\n *   - Hand visual refresh + hand-channel message rebuild\n *   - Phase gate \u2192 pre_activation (unless a DC SOR effect is pending)\n *   - Mission-specific round-start prompts (Devaron B doors/crates\x2C Chopper A Krykna push)\n *\n * Called from round.js:_runInitiativeSwapAndContinue (round 2+)\x2C handleSorMissionReveal\n * (reveal-button completion)\x2C phase-gate.js cc_drawn (round 1 normal)\x2C and\n * setup-bridge.js runDraftRandom (round 1 Draft Random).\n *\n * @param {object} game\n * @param {string} gameId\n * @param {?import('discord.js').ButtonInteraction} interaction - May be null (non-button entry)\n * @param {object} ctx - Must include all deps consumed by the body below\n */\nexport async function runStartOfRoundContinuation(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  return _continueAfterMissionSor(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx);\n}\n\n/**\n * Continuation after mission SOR rules have fired (or been skipped).\n * Runs CC passive redraws\x2C DC SOR effects\x2C hand updates\x2C phase gate\x2C mission-specific prompts.\n */\nasync function _continueAfterMissionSor(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const {\n    logGameAction\x2C client\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C updateHandVisualMessage\x2C\n    buildHandDisplayPayload\x2C sendPhaseGateMessages\x2C countTerminalsControlledByPlayer\x2C\n    getMapTokensData\x2C postDevaronDoorButtons\x2C postDevaronCratePushPrompts\x2C\n    postKryknaPushButtons\x2C saveGames\x2C checkWinConditions\x2C\n  } = ctx;\n  const mapId = game.selectedMap?.id;\n  const variant = game.selectedMission?.variant;\n\n  // CC Passive Redraw: start-of-round trigger (Rebel Graffiti \u2014 Sabine in army)\n  for (const _sorPn of [1\x2C 2]) {\n    const _sorPrResult = checkStartOfRoundPassiveRedraws(game\x2C _sorPn);\n    for (const _sorPrCard of _sorPrResult.redrawn) {\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**Passive Redraw** \u2014 **${_sorPrCard}** re-drawn from discard at start of round.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'card' });\n    }\n  }\n  // Run start-of-round DC effects (post-deploy for R1\x2C DC abilities every round)\n  const hasPendingSor = await runStartOfRoundDcEffects(game\x2C gameId\x2C client\x2C { logGameAction\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C checkWinConditions });\n  await updateHandVisualMessage(game\x2C 1\x2C client);\n  await updateHandVisualMessage(game\x2C 2\x2C client);\n  for (const pn of [1\x2C 2]) {\n    const hand = getCcHand(game\x2C pn) || [];\n    const deck = getCcDeck(game\x2C pn) || [];\n    const handId = getHandChannelId(game\x2C pn);\n    if (!handId) continue;\n    try {\n      const handCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C handId);\n      const msgs = await handCh.messages.fetch({ limit: 20 });\n      const handMsg = msgs.find((m) => m.author.bot && (m.content?.includes('Hand:') || m.content?.includes('Hand (')) && (m.components?.length > 0 || m.embeds?.some((e) => e.title?.includes('Command Cards'))));\n      if (handMsg) {\n        const payload = buildHandDisplayPayload(hand\x2C deck\x2C game.gameId\x2C game\x2C pn);\n        await handMsg.edit({ content: payload.content\x2C embeds: payload.embeds\x2C files: payload.files || []\x2C components: payload.components }).catch(discordCatch);\n      }\n    } catch (err) {\n      console.error('Failed to update hand message:'\x2C err);\n    }\n  }\n  if (!hasPendingSor) {\n    if (sendPhaseGateMessages) {\n      await sendPhaseGateMessages(game\x2C 'pre_activation'\x2C ctx);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Devaron Garrison B: terminal\u2192door selection + crate push prompts (posted after round starts)\n  const generalChannel = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C game.generalId);\n  if (mapId === 'devaron-garrison' && variant === 'b') {\n    if (!game.cratePositions) {\n      const dMap = getMapTokensData()['devaron-garrison'];\n      const allCrates = Object.values(dMap?.missionB?.positions || {}).flat().filter(Boolean).map((c) => String(c).toLowerCase());\n      game.cratePositions = {};\n      for (const c of allCrates) game.cratePositions[c] = c;\n    }\n    const p1T = countTerminalsControlledByPlayer(game\x2C 1\x2C mapId);\n    const p2T = countTerminalsControlledByPlayer(game\x2C 2\x2C mapId);\n    if ((p1T > 0 || p2T > 0) && postDevaronDoorButtons) {\n      game.pendingDoorSelections = [];\n      if (p1T > 0) game.pendingDoorSelections.push({ playerNum: 1\x2C doorsRemaining: p1T });\n      if (p2T > 0) game.pendingDoorSelections.push({ playerNum: 2\x2C doorsRemaining: p2T });\n      const dDoors = getMapTokensData()['devaron-garrison']?.doors || [];\n      await postDevaronDoorButtons(game\x2C dDoors\x2C generalChannel\x2C gameId);\n    }\n    if (postDevaronCratePushPrompts) {\n      await postDevaronCratePushPrompts(game\x2C generalChannel\x2C gameId);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Chopper Base A: build Krykna push queue and post buttons (damage fires after all pushes in modal handler)\n  if (mapId === 'chopper-base-atollon' && variant === 'a' && postKryknaPushButtons) {\n    // Lazy-init npcKrykna from missionA token positions (breaks chicken-and-egg with self-play.js)\n    if (!game.npcKrykna) {\n      const missionData = getMapTokensData()['chopper-base-atollon']?.missionA;\n      const positions = Object.values(missionData?.positions || {}).flat().filter(Boolean);\n      if (positions.length > 0) {\n        game.npcKrykna = positions.map((coord\x2C i) => ({ id: `krykna-${i + 1}`\x2C coord: String(coord).toLowerCase().trim()\x2C hp: 8\x2C maxHp: 8\x2C defeated: false }));\n      }\n    }\n    const activeKrykna = (game.npcKrykna || []).filter((k) => !k.defeated);\n    if (activeKrykna.length > 0) {\n      const _initNum = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n      const _otherNum = opponentPlayerNum(_initNum);\n      const queue = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < activeKrykna.length; i++) queue.push(i % 2 === 0 ? _initNum : _otherNum);\n      game.pendingKryknaPushQueue = queue;\n      game.kryknaPushedIds = [];\n      await postKryknaPushButtons(game\x2C generalChannel\x2C gameId);\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (interaction?.message) {\n    await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  }\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Resume status phase flow after fluctuation swap phase completes.\n * Called from map-events.js handleFluctuationSwap/handleFluctuationSkip when queue is empty.\n */\nexport async function continueAfterFluctuationSwap(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const logVars = game._pendingStatusPhaseLog || {};\n  delete game._pendingStatusPhaseLog;\n  delete game.pendingFluctuationSwapQueue;\n  delete game.pendingFluctuationSwapFirst;\n  // fluctuationSwappedThisRound is cleared at next round start in cleanupRoundStart \u2014 leave it for now\n  await _runInitiativeSwapAndContinue(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx\x2C logVars);\n}\n\n/**\n * Shared button handler: either player presses to trigger mission SOR token reveal.\n * Used by Powered Perimeter (Chopper Base Atollon B) randomRevealAndPlaceStrain.\n */\nexport async function handleSorMissionReveal(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const {\n    getGame\x2C logGameAction\x2C client\x2C getMissionRules\x2C getMapTokensData\x2C\n    runStartOfRoundRules\x2C saveGames\x2C\n  } = ctx;\n  const gameId = parseCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'sor_mission_reveal_');\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  if (interaction.user.id !== game.player1Id && interaction.user.id !== game.player2Id) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Only players in this game can press this.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  if (!game.pendingMissionSorReveal) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Mission token reveal already completed.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  game.pendingMissionSorReveal = false;\n  const mapId = game.selectedMap?.id;\n  const variant = game.selectedMission?.variant;\n  const missionRules = getMissionRules?.(mapId\x2C variant) ?? {};\n  if (runStartOfRoundRules && missionRules?.startOfRound) {\n    await runStartOfRoundRules(game\x2C mapId\x2C variant\x2C missionRules.startOfRound\x2C { logGameAction\x2C client\x2C getMapTokensData });\n  }\n  // Disable the reveal button\n  await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  await _continueAfterMissionSor(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction\x2C ctx);\n}\n\n/**\n * Run automatic start-of-round DC effects and post-deploy effects.\n * Called from handleEndEndOfRound (rounds 2+) and after CC draw (round 1).\n * @param {object} game\n * @param {string} gameId\n * @param {object} client - Discord client\n * @param {object} ctx - { logGameAction\x2C dcHealthState?\x2C dcMessageMeta? }\n */\nexport async function runStartOfRoundDcEffects(game\x2C gameId\x2C client\x2C ctx) {\n  const { logGameAction\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C checkWinConditions } = ctx;\n\n  // Post-deploy effects now handled by runPostDeployPhase() in post-deploy.js\n  // (called from the appropriate trigger points: cc-hand.js\x2C index.js Draft Random\x2C etc.)\n\n  // Start-of-round DC passive hooks (initiative player first per IA rules)\n  {\n    const _sorEff = getDcEffects() || {};\n    const _initPn = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n    const _sorPlayerOrder = _initPn === 1 ? [1\x2C 2] : [2\x2C 1];\n    for (const playerNum of _sorPlayerOrder) {\n      const dcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      const msgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < dcList.length; i++) {\n        const dc = dcList[i];\n        if (!dc || dc.defeated) continue;\n        const eff = _sorEff[dc.dcName] || _sorEff[dc.dcName?.replace(/\\s*\\[.*\\]\\s*$/\x2C '')];\n        const sIds = eff?.specialAbilityIds || [];\n\n        // Brush (Ezra Bridger): gain 4 MP at start of round\n        if (sIds.includes('brush_ezra')) {\n          const mid = msgIds[i];\n          if (mid) {\n            grantMovementBank(game\x2C mid\x2C 4);\n            await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udf3f **Brush** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** gains **4 MP** at the start of the round.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n          }\n        }\n\n        // Unstable Devices (Saska Teft): "Once during your activation" \u2014 NOT a start-of-round effect\n        // Device token is now granted during activation (activation.js)\x2C not here\n\n        // Force Slow (Cal Kestis): choose a hostile within 3 to skip activation\n        if (sIds.includes('force_slow_cal')) {\n          await _postForceSlowPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client);\n        }\n\n        // Excavation (Doctor Aphra): choose a CC from discard with cost \u22641\x2C add to hand\n        if (sIds.includes('excavation_aphra')) {\n          await _postExcavationPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client);\n        }\n\n        // Programming Override (4-LOM): choose a TRAIT at start of round\n        if (sIds.includes('programming_override_4lom')) {\n          game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n          const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n          const traits = ['TROOPER'\x2C 'SPY'\x2C 'HUNTER'\x2C 'SMUGGLER'\x2C 'FORCE USER'\x2C 'BRAWLER'\x2C 'CREATURE'\x2C 'LEADER'\x2C 'GUARDIAN'\x2C 'WOOKIEE'\x2C 'VEHICLE'];\n          const btns = traits.map(t => new ButtonBuilder()\n            .setCustomId(`prog_override_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${t.replace(/\\s/g\x2C '_')}`)\n            .setLabel(t)\n            .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n          );\n          _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Programming Override'\x2C playerNum);\n          const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n          await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udd27 **Programming Override** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C choose a TRAIT for **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** to gain this round:`\x2C {\n            phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C\n            components: rows\x2C\n            allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n          });\n        }\n\n        // Shape/Shift (Clawdite Shapeshifter): form picker at start of round\n        if (sIds.includes('shape_clawdite_elite') || sIds.includes('shape_clawdite_reg') || sIds.includes('shift_clawdite_elite') || sIds.includes('shift_clawdite_reg')) {\n          const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n          const _fk = Object.keys(game.figurePositions?.[playerNum] || {}).find(k => k.startsWith(dc.dcName + '-'));\n          const _curForm = _fk ? getConfig(game\x2C _fk)?.form : null;\n          const formCards = getFormCards();\n          const takenForms = _fk ? getFormsChosenByTeamClawdites(game\x2C playerNum\x2C _fk) : new Set();\n          const formNames = Object.keys(formCards).filter(n => !takenForms.has(n));\n          if (_fk && formNames.length > 0) {\n            game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n            const btns = formNames.map(name => new ButtonBuilder()\n              .setCustomId(`form_pick_${gameId}_${_fk}_${name}`)\n              .setLabel(name === _curForm ? `${name} (current)` : name)\n              .setStyle(name === _curForm ? ButtonStyle.Secondary : ButtonStyle.Primary)\n            );\n            _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Shape/Shift'\x2C playerNum);\n            const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n            await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udd04 **Shift** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C you may switch **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}**'s Form card (current: **${_curForm || 'none'}**):`\x2C {\n              phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C\n              components: rows\x2C\n              allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n            });\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Skirmish Upgrade timing effects (figureless DCs)\n  {\n    const _suEff = getDcEffects() || {};\n    for (const playerNum of [1\x2C 2]) {\n      const dcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n      for (const dc of dcList) {\n        if (!dc) continue;\n        const dcName = dc.dcName;\n        const eff = _suEff[dcName] || _suEff[`[${dcName}]`] || _suEff[dcName?.replace(/^\\[|\\]$/g\x2C '')];\n        if (!eff) continue;\n        const text = eff.abilityText || '';\n\n        // [First Strike]: After setup\x2C both players receive 4 VPs (round 1 only)\n        if (dcName.includes('First Strike') && game.currentRound === 1 && !game.firstStrikeFired) {\n          game.firstStrikeFired = true;\n          awardObjectiveVp(game\x2C 1\x2C 4);\n          awardObjectiveVp(game\x2C 2\x2C 4);\n          await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\u2694\ufe0f **First Strike** \u2014 Both players receive **4 VPs**.`);\n          await checkWinConditions(game\x2C client);\n        }\n\n        // [Extra Armor]: Now handled by post-deploy queue (post-deploy.js)\n\n        // [Rule by Fear]: At the start of the first game round\x2C draw 2 CCs\x2C then discard 1\n        if (dcName.includes('Rule by Fear') && game.currentRound === 1 && !game[`ruleByFearFired_p${playerNum}`]) {\n          game[`ruleByFearFired_p${playerNum}`] = true;\n          const deckKey = ccDeckKey(playerNum);\n          const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n          const deck = game[deckKey] || [];\n          const hand = game[handKey] || [];\n          const drew = [];\n          for (let d = 0; d < 2 && deck.length > 0; d++) {\n            drew.push(deck.shift());\n          }\n          hand.push(...drew);\n          game[deckKey] = deck;\n          game[handKey] = hand;\n          const drewText = drew.length ? drew.map(c => `**${c}**`).join('\x2C ') : 'none (deck empty)';\n          await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udcdc **Rule by Fear** \u2014 <@${ownerId}> drew ${drew.length} CC${drew.length !== 1 ? 's' : ''}. Choose 1 to discard in your hand channel.`\x2C {\n            allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n          });\n          if (updateHandChannelMessages) await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n          // Post discard picker in hand channel\n          if (hand.length > 0) {\n            game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n            const handChannelId = getHandChannelId(game\x2C playerNum);\n            try {\n              const handCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C handChannelId);\n              const discardBtns = hand.slice(0\x2C 25).map((card\x2C idx) => new ButtonBuilder()\n                .setCustomId(`rbf_discard_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${idx}`)\n                .setLabel(truncateLabel(card))\n                .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger)\n              );\n              _stashSorActions(game\x2C discardBtns\x2C 'Rule by Fear'\x2C playerNum);\n              const discardRows = chunkButtonsToRows(discardBtns);\n              await withDiscordRetry(() => handCh.send({ content: `<@${ownerId}> **Rule by Fear** \u2014 You drew: ${drewText}. Choose 1 card from your hand to discard:`\x2C components: discardRows\x2C allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] } }));\n            } catch (err) {\n              console.error('Rule by Fear discard picker failed:'\x2C err);\n            }\n          }\n        }\n\n        // [Rogue One]: At the start of the first game round\x2C draw 3 CCs\x2C place 2 on top of deck\n        if (dcName.includes('Rogue One') && game.currentRound === 1 && !game[`rogueOneFired_p${playerNum}`]) {\n          game[`rogueOneFired_p${playerNum}`] = true;\n          const deckKey = ccDeckKey(playerNum);\n          const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n          const deck = game[deckKey] || [];\n          const hand = game[handKey] || [];\n          const drew = [];\n          for (let d = 0; d < 3 && deck.length > 0; d++) {\n            drew.push(deck.shift());\n          }\n          hand.push(...drew);\n          game[deckKey] = deck;\n          game[handKey] = hand;\n          const drewText = drew.length ? drew.map(c => `**${c}**`).join('\x2C ') : 'none (deck empty)';\n          await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udfaf **Rogue One** \u2014 <@${ownerId}> drew ${drew.length} CC${drew.length !== 1 ? 's' : ''}. Place 2 back on top of your deck in your hand channel.`\x2C {\n            allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n          });\n          if (updateHandChannelMessages) await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n          // Post picker in hand channel\n          if (hand.length > 0) {\n            game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n            game[`pendingRogueOne_p${playerNum}`] = { remaining: 2 };\n            const handChannelId = getHandChannelId(game\x2C playerNum);\n            try {\n              const handCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C handChannelId);\n              const pickBtns = hand.slice(0\x2C 25).map((card\x2C idx) => new ButtonBuilder()\n                .setCustomId(`rogue_one_return_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${idx}`)\n                .setLabel(truncateLabel(card))\n                .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n              );\n              _stashSorActions(game\x2C pickBtns\x2C 'Rogue One'\x2C playerNum);\n              const pickRows = chunkButtonsToRows(pickBtns);\n              await withDiscordRetry(() => handCh.send({ content: `<@${ownerId}> **Rogue One** \u2014 You drew: ${drewText}. Choose a card to place on top of your deck (1 of 2):`\x2C components: pickRows\x2C allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] } }));\n            } catch (err) {\n              console.error('Rogue One return picker failed:'\x2C err);\n            }\n          }\n        }\n\n        // [Imperial Citadel]: At the start of each round\x2C place 1 Damage or Block token on this card\n        if (dcName.includes('Imperial Citadel') && text.includes('At the start of each round')) {\n          game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n          const btns = [\n            new ButtonBuilder()\n              .setCustomId(`imp_citadel_${gameId}_${playerNum}_damage`)\n              .setLabel('Place Damage Token')\n              .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger)\x2C\n            new ButtonBuilder()\n              .setCustomId(`imp_citadel_${gameId}_${playerNum}_block`)\n              .setLabel('Place Block Token')\n              .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\x2C\n          ];\n          _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Imperial Citadel'\x2C playerNum);\n          await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udff0 **Imperial Citadel** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C place 1 token on Imperial Citadel:`\x2C {\n            components: [new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(btns)]\x2C\n            allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n          });\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // Return true if there are pending async effects that block the activation phase\n  return (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) > 0;\n}\n\n/**\n * Called by resolution handlers (rbf_discard\x2C rogue_one_return) when their async\n * effect completes. Decrements the counter and triggers the activation phase when\n * all pending effects are resolved.\n */\nexport async function resolveStartOfRoundEffect(game\x2C ctx) {\n  game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 1) - 1;\n  if (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve <= 0) {\n    delete game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve;\n    delete game.pendingSorActions;\n    const { sendPhaseGateMessages\x2C saveGames } = ctx;\n    if (sendPhaseGateMessages) {\n      await sendPhaseGateMessages(game\x2C 'pre_activation'\x2C ctx);\n    }\n    if (saveGames) saveGames();\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * @param {import('discord.js').ButtonInteraction} interaction\n * @param {object} ctx - getGame\x2C replyIfGameEnded\x2C getPlayerZoneLabel\x2C logGameAction\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C saveGames\x2C shouldShowEndActivationPhaseButton\x2C countTerminalsControlledByPlayer\x2C GAME_PHASES\x2C PHASE_COLOR\x2C client\n */\nexport async function handleEndStartOfRound(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const {\n    getGame\x2C\n    replyIfGameEnded\x2C\n    getPlayerZoneLabel\x2C\n    logGameAction\x2C\n    updateHandChannelMessages\x2C\n    saveGames\x2C\n    shouldShowEndActivationPhaseButton\x2C\n    countTerminalsControlledByPlayer\x2C\n    GAME_PHASES\x2C\n    PHASE_COLOR\x2C\n    client\x2C\n  } = ctx;\n  const gameId = parseCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'end_start_of_round_');\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  if (await replyIfGameEnded(game\x2C interaction)) return;\n  if (!game.startOfRoundWhoseTurn) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Not in Start of Round window.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  if (interaction.user.id !== game.startOfRoundWhoseTurn) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: "It's not your turn in the Start of Round window."\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const initiativeId = game.initiativePlayerId;\n  const otherId = initiativeId === game.player1Id ? game.player2Id : game.player1Id;\n  if (interaction.user.id === initiativeId) {\n    game.startOfRoundWhoseTurn = otherId;\n    const initNum = initiativeId === game.player1Id ? 1 : 2;\n    const otherNum = 3 - initNum;\n    const otherZone = getPlayerZoneLabel(game\x2C otherId);\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**Start of Round** \u2014 2. Initiative done \u2713. 3. <@${otherId}> (${otherZone}Player ${otherNum}) \u2014 your turn for start-of-round effects. Click **End 'Start of Round' window** in your Hand when done.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C allowedMentions: { users: [otherId] } });\n    await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n  game.startOfRoundWhoseTurn = null;\n\n  // Post-deploy effects now handled by runPostDeployPhase() in post-deploy.js\n\n  // Start-of-round DC passive hooks (initiative player first per IA rules)\n  {\n    const _sorEff = getDcEffects() || {};\n    const _initPn = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n    const _sorPlayerOrder = _initPn === 1 ? [1\x2C 2] : [2\x2C 1];\n    for (const playerNum of _sorPlayerOrder) {\n      const dcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      const msgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < dcList.length; i++) {\n        const dc = dcList[i];\n        if (!dc || dc.defeated) continue;\n        const eff = _sorEff[dc.dcName] || _sorEff[dc.dcName?.replace(/\\s*\\[.*\\]\\s*$/\x2C '')];\n        const sIds = eff?.specialAbilityIds || [];\n\n        // Brush (Ezra Bridger): gain 4 MP at start of round\n        if (sIds.includes('brush_ezra')) {\n          const mid = msgIds[i];\n          if (mid) {\n            grantMovementBank(game\x2C mid\x2C 4);\n            await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udf3f **Brush** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** gains **4 MP** at the start of the round.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n          }\n        }\n\n        // Unstable Devices (Saska Teft): "Once during your activation" \u2014 NOT a start-of-round effect\n        // Device token is now granted during activation (activation.js)\x2C not here\n\n        // Force Slow (Cal Kestis): choose a hostile within 3 to skip activation\n        if (sIds.includes('force_slow_cal')) {\n          await _postForceSlowPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client);\n        }\n\n        // Excavation (Doctor Aphra): choose a CC from discard with cost \u22641\x2C add to hand\n        if (sIds.includes('excavation_aphra')) {\n          await _postExcavationPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client);\n        }\n\n        // Shape/Shift (Clawdite Shapeshifter): form picker at start of round\n        if (sIds.includes('shape_clawdite_elite') || sIds.includes('shape_clawdite_reg') || sIds.includes('shift_clawdite_elite') || sIds.includes('shift_clawdite_reg')) {\n          const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n          const _fk = Object.keys(game.figurePositions?.[playerNum] || {}).find(k => k.startsWith(dc.dcName + '-'));\n          const _curForm = _fk ? getConfig(game\x2C _fk)?.form : null;\n          const formCards = getFormCards();\n          const takenForms = _fk ? getFormsChosenByTeamClawdites(game\x2C playerNum\x2C _fk) : new Set();\n          const formNames = Object.keys(formCards).filter(n => !takenForms.has(n));\n          if (_fk && formNames.length > 0) {\n            game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n            const btns = formNames.map(name => new ButtonBuilder()\n              .setCustomId(`form_pick_${gameId}_${_fk}_${name}`)\n              .setLabel(name === _curForm ? `${name} (current)` : name)\n              .setStyle(name === _curForm ? ButtonStyle.Secondary : ButtonStyle.Primary)\n            );\n            _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Shape/Shift'\x2C playerNum);\n            const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n            await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udd04 **Shift** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C you may switch **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}**'s Form card (current: **${_curForm || 'none'}**):`\x2C {\n              phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C\n              components: rows\x2C\n              allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n            });\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Phase gate: both confirm SOR effects done before activation begins\n  if ((game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) > 0) {\n    await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n  const { sendPhaseGateMessages: _sorSendGate } = ctx;\n  if (_sorSendGate) {\n    await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    await _sorSendGate(game\x2C 'pre_activation'\x2C ctx);\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // Fallback: no gate function\x2C start activation directly\n  const generalChannel = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C game.generalId);\n  const roundEmbed = new EmbedBuilder()\n    .setTitle(`${GAME_PHASES.ROUND.emoji}  ROUND ${game.currentRound} - Start of Round`)\n    .setColor(PHASE_COLOR);\n  const showBtn = shouldShowEndActivationPhaseButton(game\x2C gameId);\n  const components = [];\n  if (showBtn) {\n    components.push(new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(\n      new ButtonBuilder()\n        .setCustomId(`status_phase_${gameId}`)\n        .setLabel(`End R${game.currentRound} Activation Phase`)\n        .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Secondary)\n    ));\n  }\n  const initRem = getInitiativePlayerNum(game) === 1 ? (game.p1ActivationsRemaining ?? 0) : (game.p2ActivationsRemaining ?? 0);\n  const otherRem = getInitiativePlayerNum(game) === 1 ? (game.p2ActivationsRemaining ?? 0) : (game.p1ActivationsRemaining ?? 0);\n  if (otherRem > initRem && initRem > 0) {\n    components.push(new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(\n      new ButtonBuilder()\n        .setCustomId(`pass_activation_turn_${gameId}`)\n        .setLabel(`Pass (opponent has ${otherRem - initRem} more activation${otherRem - initRem !== 1 ? 's' : ''} than you)`)\n        .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Secondary)\n    ));\n  }\n  const initPlayerNum = getInitiativePlayerNum(game);\n  const initPlayAreaId = getPlayAreaId(game\x2C initPlayerNum);\n  const passHint = otherRem > initRem && initRem > 0 ? ' You may pass (opponent has more activations).' : '';\n  const content = `<@${game.initiativePlayerId}> **Round ${game.currentRound}** \u2014 Your turn! Activate DCs in <#${initPlayAreaId}>.${passHint}`;\n  const sent = await withDiscordRetry(() => generalChannel.send({\n    content\x2C\n    embeds: [roundEmbed]\x2C\n    components\x2C\n    allowedMentions: { users: [game.initiativePlayerId] }\x2C\n  }));\n  game.roundActivationMessageId = sent.id;\n  game.roundActivationButtonShown = showBtn;\n  game.currentActivationTurnPlayerId = game.initiativePlayerId;\n  await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n  await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n// \u2500\u2500 Helpers: Force Slow & Excavation pickers (shared by handleEndEndOfRound + handleEndStartOfRound) \u2500\u2500\n\nasync function _postForceSlowPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client) {\n  const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n  const oppNum = opponentPlayerNum(playerNum);\n  // Find figure key for this DC to get its position\n  const calFk = Object.keys(game.figurePositions?.[playerNum] || {}).find(k => k.startsWith(dc.dcName + '-'));\n  const calPos = calFk ? game.figurePositions[playerNum][calFk] : null;\n  if (!calPos) {\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udc0c **Force Slow** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** has no figure on board. Skipped.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  // Find hostile figures within 3 spaces (graph distance)\n  const _fsMapId = game.selectedMap?.id;\n  const _fsMs = _fsMapId ? getMapData(_fsMapId) : null;\n  const _fsAllDoors = _fsMapId ? (_getMapTokensData()?.[_fsMapId]?.doors || []) : [];\n  const _fsOpenedSet = new Set((game.openedDoors || []).map(k => String(k).toLowerCase()));\n  const _fsClosedDoorEdges = new Set(\n    _fsAllDoors\n      .filter(e => { const a = String(e[0]).toLowerCase()\x2C b = String(e[1]).toLowerCase(); return !_fsOpenedSet.has(`${a}|${b}`) && !_fsOpenedSet.has(`${b}|${a}`); })\n      .map(e => edgeKey(e[0]\x2C e[1]))\n  );\n  const hostiles = [];\n  for (const [fk\x2C pos] of Object.entries(game.figurePositions?.[oppNum] || {})) {\n    if (!pos) continue;\n    if (countSpaces(_fsMs\x2C calPos\x2C pos\x2C _fsClosedDoorEdges) <= 3) hostiles.push({ fk\x2C dcName: dcNameFromFigureKey(fk) });\n  }\n  if (hostiles.length === 0) {\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udc0c **Force Slow** \u2014 No hostile figures within 3 spaces of **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}**. Skipped.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  if (hostiles.length === 1) {\n    // Auto-select the only target\n    game.forceSlowSkipActivation = game.forceSlowSkipActivation || {};\n    game.forceSlowSkipActivation[hostiles[0].fk] = true;\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udc0c **Force Slow** \u2014 **${hostiles[0].dcName}** will skip its next activation (only hostile in range).`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  // Multiple targets \u2014 show picker (block activation until resolved)\n  game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n  const btns = hostiles.map(({ fk\x2C dcName }) =>\n    new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`force_slow_pick_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${fk}`).setLabel(dcName).setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n  );\n  _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Force Slow'\x2C playerNum);\n  const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udc0c **Force Slow** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C choose a hostile figure within 3 spaces of **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** to skip its next activation:`\x2C {\n    phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C\n    components: rows\x2C\n    allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n  });\n}\n\nasync function _postExcavationPicker(game\x2C gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C dc\x2C logGameAction\x2C client) {\n  // Rest in Peace: block discard-pile access\n  if (game.restInPeaceActive) {\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\u26cf\ufe0f **Excavation** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}**: blocked by **Rest in Peace** (cannot retrieve from discard piles this round).`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n  const discard = getCcDiscard(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n  // Filter to cost <= 1 cards\n  const eligible = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < discard.length; i++) {\n    const ccData = getCcEffect(discard[i]);\n    const cost = ccData?.cost ?? 99;\n    if (cost <= 1) eligible.push({ name: discard[i]\x2C index: i });\n  }\n  if (eligible.length === 0) {\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\u26cf\ufe0f **Excavation** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}**: no Command Cards with cost 1 or less in discard pile.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  if (eligible.length === 1) {\n    // Auto-select the only eligible card\n    const cardName = eligible[0].name;\n    const discardKey = ccDiscardKey(playerNum);\n    const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n    game[discardKey] = discard.filter((_\x2C i) => i !== eligible[0].index);\n    game[handKey] = game[handKey] || [];\n    game[handKey].push(cardName);\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\u26cf\ufe0f **Excavation** \u2014 **${dc.displayName || dc.dcName}** retrieved **${cardName}** from discard pile (only eligible card).`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n    return;\n  }\n  // Multiple eligible \u2014 show picker (block activation until resolved)\n  game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve = (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve || 0) + 1;\n  const btns = eligible.map(({ name\x2C index }) =>\n    new ButtonBuilder().setCustomId(`excavation_pick_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${index}`).setLabel(name.slice(0\x2C 80)).setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n  );\n  _stashSorActions(game\x2C btns\x2C 'Excavation'\x2C playerNum);\n  const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\u26cf\ufe0f **Excavation** \u2014 <@${ownerId}>\x2C choose a Command Card (cost \u22641) from your discard pile to add to hand:`\x2C {\n    phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round'\x2C\n    components: rows\x2C\n    allowedMentions: { users: [ownerId] }\x2C\n  });\n}\n\n// ---- Skirmish Upgrade SOR button handlers ----\n\n/* \u2500\u2500 Extra Armor helpers \u2500\u2500 */\n\n/** Build the button label for a figure in the Extra Armor picker\x2C showing pending allocation. */\nfunction _extraArmorLabel(fk\x2C game\x2C allocation) {\n  const dcName = dcNameFromFigureKey(fk);\n  const { dgIndex\x2C figureIndex } = parseFigureKey(fk);\n  const letters = 'abcdefghij';\n  const letter = letters[figureIndex] || 'a';\n  const pending = allocation[fk] || 0;\n  const max = getMaxPowerTokens(fk);\n  const existing = (game.figurePowerTokens?.[fk] || []).length;\n  let label = `${dcName} (${dgIndex}${letter})`;\n  if (pending > 0) label += ` [${pending}/${max - existing}]`;\n  return label;\n}\n\n/** Get the button style for a figure based on its pending token count. */\nfunction _extraArmorStyle(fk\x2C allocation) {\n  const pending = allocation[fk] || 0;\n  if (pending === 0) return ButtonStyle.Primary;    // blue  \u2014 0 tokens\n  if (pending === 1) return ButtonStyle.Success;     // green \u2014 1 token\n  return ButtonStyle.Danger;                          // red   \u2014 2 tokens\n}\n\n/** Build the full Extra Armor UI rows (figure buttons + optional confirm). */\nfunction _buildExtraArmorUI(gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C allFks\x2C game\x2C allocation\x2C total) {\n  const placed = Object.values(allocation).reduce((s\x2C n) => s + n\x2C 0);\n  const remaining = total - placed;\n  const btns = allFks.slice(0\x2C 20).map(fk => new ButtonBuilder()\n    .setCustomId(`extra_armor_pick_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${fk}`)\n    .setLabel(_extraArmorLabel(fk\x2C game\x2C allocation))\n    .setStyle(_extraArmorStyle(fk\x2C allocation))\n  );\n  const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n  // Show confirm button only when all tokens are placed\n  if (remaining <= 0) {\n    rows.push(new ActionRowBuilder().addComponents(\n      new ButtonBuilder()\n        .setCustomId(`extra_armor_confirm_${gameId}_${playerNum}`)\n        .setLabel('Confirm Allocation')\n        .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Success)\n    ));\n  }\n  const content = remaining > 0\n    ? `\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Extra Armor** \u2014 Distribute Block Tokens among your figures (${remaining} of ${total} remaining):`\n    : `\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Extra Armor** \u2014 All ${total} Block Tokens allocated. Press **Confirm** to apply.`;\n  return { content\x2C components: rows };\n}\n\n/**\n * Extra Armor: cycle a figure's pending token count (0 \u2192 1 \u2192 2 \u2192 0).\n * No game-state changes until confirm.\n */\nexport async function handleExtraArmorPick(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'extra_armor_pick_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const figureKey = parts.slice(2).join('_');\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId\x2C { silent: true });\n  if (!game) return;\n  const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n  if (interaction.user.id !== ownerId) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Only the owning player can distribute Extra Armor tokens.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const pending = game[`pendingExtraArmor_p${playerNum}`];\n  if (!pending) return;\n  const total = pending.total || 4;\n  const allocation = pending.allocation || {};\n\n  // Calculate max tokens this figure can receive (cap minus existing)\n  const existing = (game.figurePowerTokens?.[figureKey] || []).length;\n  const maxForFigure = getMaxPowerTokens(figureKey) - existing;\n  const current = allocation[figureKey] || 0;\n  const placed = Object.values(allocation).reduce((s\x2C n) => s + n\x2C 0);\n\n  // Cycle: 0 \u2192 1 \u2192 2 \u2192 0 (capped by per-figure max and total remaining)\n  let next;\n  if (current >= maxForFigure || current >= 2) {\n    // At max for this figure \u2014 cycle back to 0\n    next = 0;\n  } else if (placed - current + (current + 1) > total) {\n    // Adding one more would exceed total \u2014 cycle back to 0\n    next = 0;\n  } else {\n    next = current + 1;\n  }\n\n  if (next === 0) {\n    delete allocation[figureKey];\n  } else {\n    allocation[figureKey] = next;\n  }\n  pending.allocation = allocation;\n  saveGames();\n\n  const allFks = Object.keys(game.figurePositions?.[playerNum] || {});\n  const ui = _buildExtraArmorUI(gameId\x2C playerNum\x2C allFks\x2C game\x2C allocation\x2C total);\n  await interaction.message.edit(ui).catch(discordCatch);\n}\n\n/**\n * Extra Armor confirm: apply all allocated Block Tokens at once and log.\n */\nexport async function handleExtraArmorConfirm(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'extra_armor_confirm_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId\x2C { silent: true });\n  if (!game) return;\n  const ownerId = getPlayerId(game\x2C playerNum);\n  if (interaction.user.id !== ownerId) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Only the owning player can distribute Extra Armor tokens.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const pending = game[`pendingExtraArmor_p${playerNum}`];\n  if (!pending) return;\n  const allocation = pending.allocation || {};\n  const total = pending.total || 4;\n  const placed = Object.values(allocation).reduce((s\x2C n) => s + n\x2C 0);\n  if (placed < total) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: `Still ${total - placed} token(s) left to allocate.`\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // Apply all tokens\n  const logParts = [];\n  for (const [fk\x2C count] of Object.entries(allocation)) {\n    if (count <= 0) continue;\n    grantPowerTokens(game\x2C fk\x2C 'Block'\x2C count);\n    logParts.push(`**${dcNameFromFigureKey(fk)}** +${count}`);\n  }\n  delete game[`pendingExtraArmor_p${playerNum}`];\n  saveGames();\n\n  // Single log entry for the whole allocation\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Extra Armor** \u2014 Block Tokens distributed: ${logParts.join('\x2C ')}.`);\n\n  // Check for power token overflow\n  if (game.pendingPowerTokenOverflow?.length > 0) {\n    await sendPowerTokenOverflowUI(game\x2C gameId\x2C interaction.channel\x2C playerNum\x2C saveGames);\n  }\n\n  await interaction.message.edit({ content: `\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Extra Armor** \u2014 All ${total} Block Tokens distributed.`\x2C components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n\n  // Advance post-deploy queue if active\n  if (game.postDeployQueue) {\n    const { onExtraArmorComplete } = await import('./post-deploy.js');\n    await onExtraArmorComplete(game\x2C gameId\x2C client\x2C { logGameAction\x2C saveGames });\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Extra Armor cancel: kept for backwards compat but no longer used in the new UI.\n */\nexport async function handleExtraArmorCancel(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n}\n\n/**\n * Rule by Fear: player picks 1 card from hand to discard.\n */\nexport async function handleRbfDiscard(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C updateHandVisualMessage\x2C updateDiscardPileMessage\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'rbf_discard_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const cardIdx = parseInt(parts[2]\x2C 10);\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n  const discKey = ccDiscardKey(playerNum);\n  const hand = game[handKey] || [];\n  if (cardIdx < 0 || cardIdx >= hand.length) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Invalid card selection.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const card = hand.splice(cardIdx\x2C 1)[0];\n  game[discKey] = game[discKey] || [];\n  game[discKey].push(card);\n  game[handKey] = hand;\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udcdc **Rule by Fear** \u2014 **P${playerNum}** discarded 1 CC.`);\n  await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  if (updateHandVisualMessage) await updateHandVisualMessage(game\x2C playerNum\x2C client).catch(discordCatch);\n  if (updateDiscardPileMessage) await updateDiscardPileMessage(game\x2C playerNum\x2C client).catch(discordCatch);\n  if (updateHandChannelMessages) await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n  saveGames();\n  await interaction.followUp({ content: `Discarded **${card}**.`\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n  // Resolve start-of-round blocking effect\n  if (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve > 0) {\n    await resolveStartOfRoundEffect(game\x2C ctx);\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Rogue One: player picks cards to put on top of deck (2 picks).\n */\nexport async function handleRogueOneReturn(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C updateHandVisualMessage\x2C updateHandChannelMessages\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'rogue_one_return_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const cardIdx = parseInt(parts[2]\x2C 10);\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  const pending = game[`pendingRogueOne_p${playerNum}`];\n  if (!pending || pending.remaining <= 0) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Rogue One card returns already complete.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n  const deckKey = ccDeckKey(playerNum);\n  const hand = game[handKey] || [];\n  if (cardIdx < 0 || cardIdx >= hand.length) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Invalid card selection.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const card = hand.splice(cardIdx\x2C 1)[0];\n  game[deckKey] = game[deckKey] || [];\n  game[deckKey].unshift(card);\n  game[handKey] = hand;\n  pending.remaining -= 1;\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udfaf **Rogue One** \u2014 **P${playerNum}** placed a card on top of deck (${pending.remaining} remaining).`);\n  if (pending.remaining <= 0) {\n    delete game[`pendingRogueOne_p${playerNum}`];\n    await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Both cards returned to deck.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    // Resolve start-of-round blocking effect\n    if (game.pendingStartOfRoundResolve > 0) {\n      await resolveStartOfRoundEffect(game\x2C ctx);\n    }\n  } else {\n    // Rebuild buttons with updated hand \u2014 re-stash for AI visibility\n    const pickBtns = hand.slice(0\x2C 25).map((c\x2C idx) => new ButtonBuilder()\n      .setCustomId(`rogue_one_return_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${idx}`)\n      .setLabel(truncateLabel(c))\n      .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Primary)\n    );\n    // Clear old Rogue One stash entries and re-stash with updated indices\n    if (game.pendingSorActions) {\n      game.pendingSorActions = game.pendingSorActions.filter(a => !a.customId.startsWith('rogue_one_return_'));\n    }\n    _stashSorActions(game\x2C pickBtns\x2C 'Rogue One'\x2C playerNum);\n    const pickRows = chunkButtonsToRows(pickBtns);\n    await interaction.message.edit({ components: pickRows }).catch(discordCatch);\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: `Placed **${card}** on deck. Pick 1 more card to return.`\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n  }\n  if (updateHandVisualMessage) await updateHandVisualMessage(game\x2C playerNum\x2C client).catch(discordCatch);\n  if (updateHandChannelMessages) await updateHandChannelMessages(game\x2C client);\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Channel the Force: player picks a FORCE USER CC from deck to add to hand.\n */\nexport async function handleCtfPick(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C updateHandVisualMessage\x2C logGameAction\x2C client\x2C dcHealthState\x2C dcMessageMeta } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'ctf_pick_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const pickIdx = parseInt(parts[2]\x2C 10);\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  const pending = game[`pendingChannelTheForce_p${playerNum}`];\n  if (!pending) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'No Channel the Force pending.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const picked = pending.cards[pickIdx];\n  if (!picked) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Invalid selection.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const deckKey = ccDeckKey(playerNum);\n  const handKey = ccHandKey(playerNum);\n  const deck = game[deckKey] || [];\n  const cardIdx = deck.indexOf(picked.name);\n  if (cardIdx < 0) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Card no longer in deck.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  // Remove from deck\x2C add to hand\n  deck.splice(cardIdx\x2C 1);\n  game[handKey] = [...(game[handKey] || [])\x2C picked.name];\n  // Shuffle deck\n  for (let i = deck.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n    const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n    [deck[i]\x2C deck[j]] = [deck[j]\x2C deck[i]];\n  }\n  game[deckKey] = deck;\n  delete game[`pendingChannelTheForce_p${playerNum}`];\n  // Determine cost of the chosen card for Strain\n  const ccEffData = getCcEffectsData?.()?.cards || {};\n  const ccEff = ccEffData[picked.name];\n  const cost = ccEff?.cost ?? 0;\n  await interaction.message.edit({\n    content: `**Channel the Force** \u2014 Added **${picked.name}** to hand. Deck shuffled.`\x2C\n    components: []\x2C\n  }).catch(discordCatch);\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C\n    `**Channel the Force** \u2014 P${playerNum} searched deck and added **${picked.name}** (cost ${cost}) to hand. Deck shuffled.`\x2C\n    { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'card' });\n  // Apply Strain to a friendly FORCE USER figure equal to cost\n  if (cost > 0) {\n    const dcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n    const dcEffAll = getDcEffects?.() || {};\n    const fuFigures = [];\n    const figPos = game.figurePositions?.[playerNum] || {};\n    for (const dc of dcList) {\n      const dn = dc?.dcName || dc;\n      if (/^\\[.+\\]$/.test(dn)) continue;\n      const eff = dcEffAll[dn];\n      const kws = (eff?.keywords || []).map(k => String(k).toUpperCase());\n      if (!kws.includes('FORCE USER')) continue;\n      for (const [fk\x2C pos] of Object.entries(figPos)) {\n        if (fk.startsWith(dn + '-') && pos) fuFigures.push({ fk\x2C dcName: dn });\n      }\n    }\n    if (fuFigures.length === 1) {\n      // Auto-apply strain to only FORCE USER\n      const { fk\x2C dcName: fuName } = fuFigures[0];\n      // Find the DC message ID for this figure\n      const _ctfDcMsgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      const _ctfDcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n      let _ctfFigMsgId = null;\n      for (let i = 0; i < _ctfDcList.length; i++) {\n        if ((_ctfDcList[i]?.dcName || _ctfDcList[i]) === fuName) { _ctfFigMsgId = _ctfDcMsgIds[i]; break; }\n      }\n      if (_ctfFigMsgId && dcHealthState) {\n        const figMatch = fk.match(/-(\\d+)$/);\n        const figIdx = figMatch ? parseInt(figMatch[1]\x2C 10) : 0;\n        reduceHp(dcHealthState\x2C game\x2C _ctfFigMsgId\x2C figIdx\x2C cost\x2C playerNum);\n      }\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C\n        `**Channel the Force** \u2014 **${fuName}** suffers **${cost} Strain**.`\x2C\n        { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'condition' });\n    } else if (fuFigures.length > 1) {\n      // Multiple FORCE USER figures \u2014 show picker\n      game.pendingChannelTheForceStrain = { playerNum\x2C cost\x2C figures: fuFigures };\n      const handChId = getHandChannelId(game\x2C playerNum);\n      if (handChId) {\n        try {\n          const handCh = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C handChId);\n          const btns = fuFigures.slice(0\x2C 10).map((f\x2C i) =>\n            new ButtonBuilder()\n              .setCustomId(`ctf_strain_${gameId}_${playerNum}_${i}`)\n              .setLabel(f.dcName)\n              .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger)\n          );\n          const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n          await handCh.send({\n            content: `**Channel the Force** \u2014 Choose a FORCE USER figure to suffer **${cost} Strain**:`\x2C\n            components: rows.slice(0\x2C 5)\x2C\n          });\n        } catch (err) {\n          console.error('Channel the Force strain pick error:'\x2C err);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  if (updateHandVisualMessage) await updateHandVisualMessage(game\x2C playerNum\x2C client).catch(discordCatch);\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Channel the Force: player picks which FORCE USER figure suffers Strain.\n */\nexport async function handleCtfStrain(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C logGameAction\x2C client\x2C dcHealthState } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'ctf_strain_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const figIdx = parseInt(parts[2]\x2C 10);\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  const pending = game.pendingChannelTheForceStrain;\n  if (!pending || pending.playerNum !== playerNum) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'No Channel the Force strain pending.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  const fig = pending.figures[figIdx];\n  if (!fig) {\n    await interaction.followUp({ content: 'Invalid selection.'\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n    return;\n  }\n  // Apply strain via dcHealthState\n  const _ctsDcMsgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n  const _ctsDcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n  let _ctsFigMsgId = null;\n  for (let i = 0; i < _ctsDcList.length; i++) {\n    if ((_ctsDcList[i]?.dcName || _ctsDcList[i]) === fig.dcName) { _ctsFigMsgId = _ctsDcMsgIds[i]; break; }\n  }\n  if (_ctsFigMsgId && dcHealthState) {\n    const figMatch = fig.fk.match(/-(\\d+)$/);\n    const figIdx = figMatch ? parseInt(figMatch[1]\x2C 10) : 0;\n    reduceHp(dcHealthState\x2C game\x2C _ctsFigMsgId\x2C figIdx\x2C pending.cost\x2C playerNum);\n  }\n  delete game.pendingChannelTheForceStrain;\n  await interaction.message.edit({\n    content: `**Channel the Force** \u2014 **${fig.dcName}** suffered **${pending.cost} Strain**.`\x2C\n    components: []\x2C\n  }).catch(discordCatch);\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C\n    `**Channel the Force** \u2014 **${fig.dcName}** suffers **${pending.cost} Strain**.`\x2C\n    { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'condition' });\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Imperial Citadel: player picks Focus or Damage token to place on the card.\n */\nexport async function handleImpCitadel(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const parts = splitCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'imp_citadel_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const tokenType = parts[2]; // 'damage' or 'block'\n  const game = await requireGame(interaction\x2C getGame\x2C gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  game.imperialCitadelTokens = game.imperialCitadelTokens || { damage: 0\x2C block: 0 };\n  // Migrate legacy focus\u2192block if present\n  if (game.imperialCitadelTokens.focus != null) {\n    game.imperialCitadelTokens.block = (game.imperialCitadelTokens.block || 0) + (game.imperialCitadelTokens.focus || 0);\n    delete game.imperialCitadelTokens.focus;\n  }\n  const label = tokenType === 'damage' ? 'Damage' : 'Block';\n  game.imperialCitadelTokens[tokenType] = (game.imperialCitadelTokens[tokenType] || 0) + 1;\n  const total = game.imperialCitadelTokens;\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83c\udff0 **Imperial Citadel** \u2014 placed **1 ${label}** token (now: ${total.damage} Damage\x2C ${total.block} Block).`);\n  await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  // Refresh Imperial Citadel embed in play area to show updated token counts\n  try {\n    const dcList = getDcList(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n    const msgIds = getDcMessageIds(game\x2C playerNum) || [];\n    const idx = dcList.findIndex(dc => dc?.dcName === '[Imperial Citadel]');\n    if (idx >= 0 && msgIds[idx]) {\n      const icMsgId = msgIds[idx];\n      const chId = getPlayAreaId(game\x2C playerNum);\n      const ch = await fetchGameChannel(client\x2C chId);\n      const msg = await ch.messages.fetch(icMsgId);\n      const exhausted = ctx.dcExhaustedState?.get(icMsgId) || false;\n      const { embed\x2C files } = await ctx.renderDcEmbed(game\x2C icMsgId\x2C ctx);\n      const comps = ctx.getDcPlayAreaComponents(icMsgId\x2C exhausted\x2C game\x2C '[Imperial Citadel]');\n      await msg.edit({ embeds: [embed]\x2C files: files?.length ? files : []\x2C components: comps }).catch(discordCatch);\n    }\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('Failed to refresh Imperial Citadel embed:'\x2C err);\n  }\n  await resolveStartOfRoundEffect(game\x2C ctx);\n  saveGames();\n  await interaction.followUp({ content: `Placed ${label} token on Imperial Citadel.`\x2C ephemeral: true }).catch(discordCatch);\n}\n\n/**\n * Handle prog_override_ button: 4-LOM chose a TRAIT for the round.\n * customId: prog_override_{gameId}_{playerNum}_{TRAIT}\n */\nexport async function handleProgrammingOverride(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n  const { getGame\x2C logGameAction\x2C client\x2C saveGames } = ctx;\n  const withoutPrefix = parseCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'prog_override_');\n  const parts = withoutPrefix.split('_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const playerNum = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const trait = parts.slice(2).join(' '); // e.g. "FORCE_USER" \u2192 "FORCE USER"\n  const game = getGame(gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n  game.roundProgrammingOverrideTrait = game.roundProgrammingOverrideTrait || {};\n  game.roundProgrammingOverrideTrait[playerNum] = trait;\n  await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `\ud83d\udd27 **Programming Override** \u2014 **4-LOM** gains **${trait}** until end of round.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'round' });\n  await interaction.message.edit({ components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n  await resolveStartOfRoundEffect(game\x2C ctx);\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Handle doubt_fig_ button: player picks a hostile figure to remove a condition/token from.\n * customId: doubt_fig_{gameId}_{playerNum}_{figureKey|skip}\n */\nexport async function handleDoubtFigPick(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const full = parseCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'doubt_fig_');\n  const parts = full.split('_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const pn = parseInt(parts[1]\x2C 10);\n  const target = parts.slice(2).join('_');\n\n  const game = getGame(gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n\n  if (target === 'skip') {\n    await interaction.message.edit({ content: '**[Doubt]** \u2014 Skipped condition/token removal.'\x2C components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    saveGames();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const targetFk = target;\n  const targetDcName = dcNameFromFigureKey(targetFk);\n  const conds = game.figureConditions?.[targetFk] || [];\n  const tokens = game.figurePowerTokens?.[targetFk] || [];\n  const removables = [\n    ...conds.map((c\x2C i) => ({ type: 'condition'\x2C value: c\x2C index: i }))\x2C\n    ...tokens.map((t\x2C i) => ({ type: 'token'\x2C value: t\x2C index: i }))\x2C\n  ];\n\n  if (removables.length === 1) {\n    // Only one option \u2014 auto-remove\n    const item = removables[0];\n    if (item.type === 'condition') {\n      filterCondition(game\x2C targetFk\x2C item.value);\n    } else {\n      const arr = game.figurePowerTokens[targetFk] || [];\n      arr.splice(item.index\x2C 1);\n      if (arr.length === 0) delete game.figurePowerTokens[targetFk];\n    }\n    const label = item.type === 'condition' ? item.value : `${item.value} Token`;\n    await interaction.message.edit({ content: `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded **${label}** from **${targetDcName}**.`\x2C components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n    await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded ${label} from ${targetDcName}.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'card' });\n  } else {\n    // Multiple options \u2014 show picker\n    const btns = removables.slice(0\x2C 24).map(({ type\x2C value }\x2C i) => {\n      const label = type === 'condition' ? `Discard ${value}` : `Discard ${value} Token`;\n      return new ButtonBuilder()\n        .setCustomId(`doubt_remove_${gameId}_${pn}_${targetFk}_${type}_${i}`)\n        .setLabel(truncateLabel(label))\n        .setStyle(ButtonStyle.Danger);\n    });\n    const rows = chunkButtonsToRows(btns);\n    await interaction.message.edit({\n      content: `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Choose a condition or Power Token to discard from **${targetDcName}**:`\x2C\n      components: rows.slice(0\x2C 5)\x2C\n    }).catch(discordCatch);\n  }\n  saveGames();\n}\n\n/**\n * Handle doubt_remove_ button: player picks which condition/token to remove.\n * customId: doubt_remove_{gameId}_{playerNum}_{figureKey}_{condition|token}_{index}\n */\nexport async function handleDoubtRemove(interaction\x2C ctx) {\n  await interaction.deferUpdate().catch(discordCatch);\n  const { getGame\x2C saveGames\x2C logGameAction\x2C client } = ctx;\n  const full = parseCustomId(interaction.customId\x2C 'doubt_remove_');\n  // Last two parts are type and index; everything before (after gameId and pn) is the figureKey\n  const parts = full.split('_');\n  const gameId = parts[0];\n  const indexStr = parts.pop();\n  const type = parts.pop(); // 'condition' or 'token'\n  const targetFk = parts.slice(2).join('_');\n\n  const game = getGame(gameId);\n  if (!game) return;\n\n  const targetDcName = dcNameFromFigureKey(targetFk);\n  const idx = parseInt(indexStr\x2C 10);\n\n  if (type === 'condition') {\n    const conds = game.figureConditions?.[targetFk] || [];\n    if (idx < conds.length) {\n      const removed = conds[idx];\n      filterCondition(game\x2C targetFk\x2C removed);\n      await interaction.message.edit({ content: `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded **${removed}** from **${targetDcName}**.`\x2C components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded ${removed} from ${targetDcName}.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'card' });\n    }\n  } else if (type === 'token') {\n    const tokens = game.figurePowerTokens?.[targetFk] || [];\n    if (idx < tokens.length) {\n      const removed = tokens[idx];\n      tokens.splice(idx\x2C 1);\n      if (tokens.length === 0) delete game.figurePowerTokens[targetFk];\n      else game.figurePowerTokens[targetFk] = tokens;\n      await interaction.message.edit({ content: `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded **${removed} Token** from **${targetDcName}**.`\x2C components: [] }).catch(discordCatch);\n      await logGameAction(game\x2C client\x2C `**[Doubt]** \u2014 Discarded ${removed} Token from ${targetDcName}.`\x2C { phase: 'ROUND'\x2C icon: 'card' });\n    }\n  }\n  saveGames();\n}\n
