m {Snowflake} channelId The id of the channel\n * @param {Snowflake} [guildId] The id of the guild\n * @returns {string}\n */\n\n/**\n * Formats a message link for a channel.\n * @method messageLink\n * @param {Snowflake} channelId The id of the channel\n * @param {Snowflake} messageId The id of the message\n * @param {Snowflake} [guildId] The id of the guild\n * @returns {string}\n */\n\n/**\n * A message formatting timestamp style\x2C as defined in\n * [here](https://discord.com/developers/docs/reference#message-formatting-timestamp-styles).\n * * `t` Short time format\x2C consisting of hours and minutes\x2C e.g. 16:20.\n * * `T` Long time format\x2C consisting of hours\x2C minutes\x2C and seconds\x2C e.g. 16:20:30.\n * * `d` Short date format\x2C consisting of day\x2C month\x2C and year\x2C e.g. 20/04/2021.\n * * `D` Long date format\x2C consisting of day\x2C month\x2C and year\x2C e.g. 20 April 2021.\n * * `f` Short date-time format\x2C consisting of short date and short time formats\x2C e.g. 20 April 2021 16:20.\n * * `F` Long date-time format\x2C consisting of long date and short time formats\x2C e.g. Tuesday\x2C 20 April 2021 16:20.\n * * `R` Relative time format\x2C consisting of a relative duration format\x2C e.g. 2 months ago.\n * @typedef {string} TimestampStylesString\n */\n\n/**\n * Formats a date into a short date-time string.\n * @method time\n * @param {number|Date} [date] The date to format\n * @param {TimestampStylesString} [style] The style to use\n * @returns {string}\n */\n\n/**\n * Contains various Discord-specific functions for formatting messages.\n * @deprecated This class is redundant as all methods of the class can be imported from discord.js directly.\n */\nclass Formatters extends null {\n  /**\n   * Formats the content into a block quote.\n   * <info>This needs to be at the start of the line for Discord to format it.</info>\n   * @method blockQuote\n   * @memberof Formatters\n   * @param {string} content The content to wrap\n   * @retur